(7786103, 1290798, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> Congrats on a top 10 finish!  Looking through this challenge, you were up against some really strong images.  I love that area of the country, and I can almost feel the peace just looking at the capture.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> I believe you captured and presented just what you were going for in this one.  Of course, a CP filter and some post-processing would have made the sky and ocean really pop, and I believe that would have grown your votes a bit.  Even still, nice capture.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I did not vote in this challenge, but, after looking through the entries, this one would have probably been a 5 for me.  With that in mind, I believe that the entry was scored well.  Again, congrats on a top 10, and thanks for sharing it with us all.
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: Congrats on a top 10 finish!  Looking through this challenge, you were up against some really strong images.  I love that area of the country, and I can almost feel the peace just looking at the capture.

My ideas for improvement:  I believe you captured and presented just what you were going for in this one.  Of course, a CP filter and some post-processing would have made the sky and ocean really pop, and I believe that would have grown your votes a bit.  Even still, nice capture.

Where I would have/did score this entry: I did not vote in this challenge, but, after looking through the entries, this one would have probably been a 5 for me.  With that in mind, I believe that the entry was scored well.  Again, congrats on a top 10, and thanks for sharing it with us all.

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-05 08:00:34.000000', NULL, 0);
